{
 "note": "Central Thai. Mae Hong Son is Shan country and older people may answer in Tai Yai, but Central Thai is understood the whole way round. Tones on the 'say' line: a mid, a-grave low, a-circumflex falling, a-acute high, a-caron rising.",
 "particle": {
  "en": "End a sentence with khrap if you are a man, kha if you are a woman. It is most of the difference between a question and an order.",
